{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05606","headline":"孤兴 · 贺朝","name":"孤兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴日暖珠箔，夭桃色正新。\n红粉青镜中，娟娟可怜嚬。\n君子在遐险，蕙心谁见珍。\n罗幕空掩昼，玉颜静移春。\n江瑟语幽独，再三情未申。\n黄鹄千里翅，芳音迟所因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}